Package: streamlab
Version: 1.0.10
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ffmpeg
Maintainer: StreamLab Open Source <https://github.com/nomi181472/lab-stream-simulator>
Description: Multi-Protocol Virtual IP Camera Simulator & Interoperability Lab
 StreamLab simulates RTSP, RTMP, HLS, and WebRTC surveillance cameras
 with an embedded Next.js Mission Control UI, ONVIF discovery, and dynamic synthetic feeds.
